# Component versions: the only place they are written.
#
# Each component has its own version, and they may diverge: bump only the one
# you change. Read by the Makefile (bridge and relay ldflags, `make bar`),
# macos-bar/build.sh, deploy/relay/deploy.sh and the Wear OS Gradle build.
# herdr-plugin.toml cannot read files: keep its `version` equal to
# BRIDGE_VERSION (`make check-versions` fails when they differ).
#
# The Go binaries add the commit they were built from on their own, e.g.
# "0.3.0 (c8aa72e)": never write a commit here.
#
# WEAROS_VERSION_CODE must always increase: Android refuses to update an
# installed app to a lower or equal code.
#
# GitHub releases are date-tagged snapshots of the whole repo (vYYYY.MM.DD)
# whose notes list the versions below.
#
# Syntax (make's, like agent-watch.env): bare KEY=value lines, no quotes, no
# spaces, comments on their own line.

BRIDGE_VERSION=0.3.0
RELAY_VERSION=0.3.0
MENUBAR_VERSION=0.3.0
WEAROS_VERSION_NAME=1.1.0
WEAROS_VERSION_CODE=2
